<section id="why" class="section why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Why</p>
        <h2 id="why-title">A small tool should cost like a small tool<span class="dot">.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">
        Simple utility apps have turned into subscriptions and feature piles: a monthly fee for a checklist, an account
        for a timer, the one feature you need buried under the ones you don’t. We’d rather build the small tool and charge for it once,
        or not at all.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

